# The draw order at the hard places (docs/design/draw-order.md §6.4), at 1x, 1/2 and 1/4:
# every pair drawn that overlaps on screen goes the comparator's way and no cycle is broken
# (city order), nobody is drawn below the floor or deck they stand on (city sunk), and zoomed
# out nobody shows more than 2 rows inside something in front of them (city covered). The
# shots/order_* frames are the golden set for each place and zoom.
set season spring
set day 9
set time 0.17
set clock day
set weather clear
# the Pons Fabricius and the Tiber island: walkers on the deck between its parapets, barges under it
set city 112,1121
set city camera
set world 112 1121 1
wait 90
expect city order 0 0
expect city sunk 0 0
shot shots/order_tiber_1x.png
set world 112 1121 0.5
wait 60
expect city order 0 0
expect city covered 2 0 0
expect city on_items 1 400
shot shots/order_tiber_half.png
set world 112 1121 0.25
wait 60
expect city order 0 0
expect city covered 2 0 0
shot shots/order_tiber_quarter.png
